# Stream apply order for this project, most-dependent-first.
#
# ACROSS streams order normally does NOT matter -- streams touch disjoint files
# and commute (n64/CLAUDE.md). Ocarina of Time is the documented exception: the
# `personal` stream renames ~206 decomp symbols and 18 files, so ANY later
# stream must be written against the renamed tree. Applying a stream before the
# renames would make it patch symbols that no longer exist by that name.
#
# One stream per line; streams listed here apply first, in this order. Any
# stream not listed applies afterwards, alphabetically. Comments and blank
# lines are ignored.
personal
